  "reflectionQuestion": "The pit was dark and the cry rose out of it. What does it feel like to call out from a place so low you no longer believed any voice could reach above it, and to find that the hearing had been waiting before the words left your mouth?",
  "reflectionText": "The pit was dark and the cry went up out of it. What doth it feel like to call out from a place so low thou couldst not believe any voice would reach above it, and to find that the hearing had been waiting before ever the words left thy mouth?",
